      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FASCINATE GLORY (2) spotted a start but wound up strongly late and finished third and beaten 3 lengths (23.30) at this track in Mix 1/2/3. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Key chance in this line up. LET'S TROT WILL (6) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.88) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Can do much better this time. ZIPPING DELORIS (4) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing second and beaten 1.75 lengths (23.50) behind LIZZIE LONG LEGS at this track. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. RIE BALE (1) can feature with the right run.",
